{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03160","headline":"商洛山行怀古 · 张九龄","name":"商洛山行怀古","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"园绮值秦末，嘉遁此山阿。\n陈迹向千古，荒途始一过。\n硕人久沦谢，乔木自森罗。\n故事昔尝览，遗风今岂讹。\n泌泉空活活，樵叟独皤皤。\n是处清晖满，从中幽兴多。\n长怀赤松意，复忆紫芝歌。\n避世辞轩冕，逢时解薜萝。\n盛明今在运，吾道竟如何。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03160.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03160","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}